\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Peer Repair and Fusion{}. Prefix observations fit the peer regressions and VAR. At prediction time, regressions fill only missing target cells in the most recent 192 hours. Earlier history and auxiliary entries retain their original values or missingness. The repaired long history supplies one frozen Chronos-2 forecast. A second branch filters the unrepaired recent observations with the VAR and forecasts its final state. The two point predictions receive fixed equal weights. All input observations precede the forecast origin.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method}{{1}{3}{\method {}. Prefix observations fit the peer regressions and VAR. At prediction time, regressions fill only missing target cells in the most recent 192 hours. Earlier history and auxiliary entries retain their original values or missingness. The repaired long history supplies one frozen Chronos-2 forecast. A second branch filters the unrepaired recent observations with the VAR and forecasts its final state. The two point predictions receive fixed equal weights. All input observations precede the forecast origin}{figure.1}{}}
